title: 주2_화_1교시_강의실_신아산_영문
---
{name()}: *Huff... puff...*
(I overslept and ended up being late to class...)
{name()}: Sorry... Excuse me... Sorry...
(Ignoring the professor's glaring gaze, I managed to squeeze through the narrow gaps in the classroom and snag a seat in the very front row.)
<<show san_blush>>
(As luck would have it, ASan was sitting right next to me, her eyes sparkling with focus.)
{name()}: I should try talking to her later.
<<play 공통_웅성>>
<<wait 2>>
(Finally, it's break time.)
{name()}: You're taking this class too?
<<play san_sound>>
<<show san_idle>>
ASan: Yep. I'm actually really into bands.
ASan: That's why I prioritized this elective, even though registering for my major classes was a bloodbath with an 8-to-1 ratio.
(Wait, if your major is 8 to 1, shouldn't you have prioritized THAT instead?!)
<<show san_neg>>
<<play 신아산_흠>>
ASan: Because you were late and making a scene, I missed the 12 minute and 30 second mark of the lecture!
ASan: What if that part is on the exam?! Well?! Tell me!!!
(ASan looks pretty annoyed...)
<<choice 주2_화_1교시_강의실_신아산_긍정1_영문 "By the way, do you have a favorite band?" 주2_화_1교시_강의실_신아산_부정1_영문 "I'm sorry." true>>
(Should I try to change the subject to something she's interested in?)
===

title: 주2_화_1교시_강의실_신아산_긍정1_영문
---
ASan: Because of you—
{name()}: By the way, do you have a favorite band?
<<show san_idle>>
ASan: ...My favorite band?
ASan: I used to love Day-Five. Oh, so Day-Five is like, a group formed by some members from an audition program, and wait, the audition pro—
{name()}: Oh! I know Day-Five!
{name()}: I listen to them pretty often too. Especially that song, "You Were Handsome."
<<show san_shock>>
<<change lvSan 5>>
<<like 신아산>>
ASan: You actually know that song?
<<show san_smile>>
ASan: Wow... you've actually got some taste, don't you?
ASan: That band is actually the reason I started playing an instrument.
{name()}: Which instrument?
<<show san_spec>>
ASan: The bass.
<<play 신아산_웃음>>
ASan: Well? Pretty cool, right?
Prof: Class is starting.
<<show san_idle>>
(Break time ended before I could even react.)
(Visualizing her holding a bass... she might actually look kind of cool.)
<<end>>
===

title: 주2_화_1교시_강의실_신아산_부정1_영문
---
ASan: BECAUSE OF YOU!!!!!!!!!
{name()}: ......I'm sorry.
<<show san_idle>>
ASan: ....
ASan: What did you say?
{name()}: I was up late finishing some stuff and I just overslept..
{name()}: I'm sorry for being loud and distracting.
<<show san_blush>>
{name()}: I'll find out what happened at the 12:30 mark, no matter what.
{name()}: Sorry again.
ASan: ........
<<change lvSan 10>>
<<like 신아산>>
<<play 신아산_흠>>
ASan: Ah... I mean, it's not like I was demanding an apology or anything..
ASan: I'm recording the lecture anyway, so you don't have to go that far.
ASan: ....
ASan: Sorry for snapping at you.
{name()}: No, it was my fault.
<<show san_smile>>
<<play 신아산_웃음>>
ASan: If you're really sorry, come listen to me play the bass sometime.
{name()}: The bass?
{name()}: You know how to play?
ASan: Of course. Every lady should naturally possess a certain level of mastery over the bass guitar.
(Where does she even get these ideas?!)
<<show san_idle>>
ASan: Just so you know, I don't play for just anyone.
Prof: Class is starting.
(Break time ended before I could respond.)
(The image of her eyes sparkling while talking about the bass lingered in my mind.)
<<end>>
===